      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Sorter Flame Graph — AI-assisted bottleneck analysis\n\nThis dashboard visualises CPU profiles collected by **Pyroscope** from the `flame-ai.sorter` service. The bottom panel is an interactive flame graph; the wider a function block is, the more CPU time it consumes.\n\n### To get an AI explanation\n1. Click anywhere on the flame graph below.\n2. Open the panel menu (three dots, top-right of the panel).\n3. Choose **Explain with AI** (provided by the `grafana-llm-app` plugin, configured against OpenAI).\n4. Read the natural-language diagnosis identifying the hot stack frame (expect `bubble_sort`).\n\n### To reproduce load\n```\nkubectl port-forward -n flame-ai svc/sorter 8080:80\nk6 run k6/scenarios/slow-flood.js\n```\n"
      }
    },
